      <description><![CDATA[<p>Pause and Cancel now work during copies to a NAS (they used to wait for the verification read-back), and every transfer has Pause and Cancel on the strip and in the HUD. Folders light up when you drag onto them while a transfer runs, and the HUD shows the transfer belonging to the tab you're on.</p>]]></description>
